You are assisting with business process modelling.

SENTENCES
- An e-commerce company has a comprehensive order fulfillment process
- When a customer places an order, the system records the order details

STATEMENT
the organisation running the described process sells goods or services to customers, for purposes relating to its trade, business, craft or profession

Do these sentences, on their own and taken together, state that the statement is true? Answer yes or no with one line of reason.
Answer with one JSON object that follows the JSON schema below. Output only the JSON, with no other text.

JSON SCHEMA
{
  "properties": {
    "answer": {
      "description": "yes if the sentence on its own states it, otherwise no",
      "enum": [
        "yes",
        "no"
      ],
      "title": "Answer",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "reason": {
      "description": "One line of reason",
      "title": "Reason",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "answer",
    "reason"
  ],
  "title": "VerifierOutputV2",
  "type": "object"
}

message.content:
{
  "answer": "yes",
  "reason": "The description of an e-commerce company with an order fulfillment process explicitly indicates that the organization sells goods or services to customers as part of its business."
